I just made a new cleanup release of Milo-2.2.

Changes:

  * Cleaned up much unneccesary stuff. Should not break that easy when changing

    2.2.x kernels now.

    milo is about 20k smaller than the -15 release

  * Made free bios emulation work with Milo-2.2 again. (to be replaced soon)

  * fmu compiles again. Use with care!

